# Third-party notices

## SQLite

PositronicKit includes a vendored copy of the SQLite amalgamation under
`Sources/CPKSQLite`, built into the optional `PKSQLiteStorage` product.

SQLite is in the **public domain**. The SQLite authors dedicate the source code to the public
domain; see <https://www.sqlite.org/copyright.html>. The vendored version, its pinned SHA3-256,
and the exact download URL are recorded in `Sources/CPKSQLite/VENDORED.md`.

The vendored copy is compiled with every public `sqlite3_*` symbol renamed to `pk_sqlite3_*` for
symbol isolation from the system `libsqlite3`.
